    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      70.32,
      533.28,
      293.55,
      543.35
    ],
    "text": "Purpose of acquisition: Knuckles Range Reservation",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      70.32,
      552.24,
      308.94,
      634.31
    ],
    "text": "Two allotments of land called Angurupolawatta in totalextent of about 4.0168 hectares depicted as Lot 01 in thePreliminary Plan No. P.P. Maha 6735 Dated 19.01.2018 preparedby the Senior superintendent of Surveys - Kandy District,situated in the village called Mangoda in the Grama NiladhariDivision No. 806 of Mangoda in the Udasiyapattuwa KoraleMinor Division in the Divisional Secretary's Division of",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
