      348.48,
      560.51,
      394.55
    ],
    "text": "01. Lot No. 1Name of the land: Angurupolawatta; Description of theLand: Jungle; Claimant: H. M. Muthubanda, Mangoda,Medamahanuwara; Extent: 4.0168Hectares.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
