    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      323.28,
      408.48,
      560.75,
      514.55
    ],
    "text": "All Persons interested in the aforesaid land are herebyrequired to appear personally, or by agents duly authorizedin writing, before me at the Medadumbara DivisionalSecretariat on the 24th day of April, 2019 at 10.00 a.m. and arehereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) onor before the 17th day of April, 2019 .The nature of theirinterest in the aforesaid land, the particulars of their claimsfor compensation and the details of the computation of suchamount.",
